OL,3,GNEWSATeen who died after 999 call
OL,4,Asuffered neck injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who died after police were
OL,7,Falerted to a "possible break-in"
OL,8,Fsuffered "compression of the neck", a
OL,9,Fcoroner has heard.
OL,11,FHarry Wilson, 17, died in Soulbury
OL,12,FRoad, Linslade, Bedfordshire, in
OL,13,FAugust, about 90 minutes after a member
OL,14,Fof the public called police, coroner
OL,15,FSophie Lomas was told.
OL,17,FLomas was given the detail when opening
OL,18,Fan inquest into Wilson's death at a
OL,19,Fhearing in Ampthill, Bedfordshire, on
OL,20,FWednesday.
